== Effects ==
* Spawns 2 {{e|Bone Heart|n}}s on the ground near Isaac.

== Notes ==
* Some {{r|Super Secret Room}} layouts can force hearts in them to be of one type. Using '''V - The Hierophant?''' in these rooms can transform the bone hearts into other types of hearts, which may be an unwanted outcome.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|n}}: Spawns 3 {{e|Bone Heart}}s.
** {{I|Tarot Cloth|n}} + {{i|Blank Card}} + {{i|Car Battery|n}} : Spawns 6 bone hearts.

